{
  "maxFiles": 20,
  "maxLines": 800,
  "freePatterns": [
    "package-lock.json",
    "pnpm-lock.yaml",
    "yarn.lock",
    "npm-shrinkwrap.json",
    "*.min.js",
    "*.min.css",
    "*.map",
    "*.snap",
    "dist/",
    "build/",
    "vendor/",
    "node_modules/",
    "workflow/verify-evidence.md",
    "workflow/INDEX.md",
    "workflow/metrics.md",
    ".agents/notes/engine-map.md"
  ],
  "note": "一个 PR 装得下一次评审。默认 20 文件 / 800 新增行（pstack 借鉴）；删除行、二进制、lockfile、生成物免费。先 advisory 校准本仓，再按 PR_SIZE_STRICT=1 收紧。"
}
